  <name>Slayer Editor</name>
  <summary>Lightweight code editor with an embedded terminal</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Slayer Editor is a fast code editor with syntax highlighting, tabs and an
    embedded terminal that can be docked on any edge of the window. Press F5 to
    compile and run C, C++, Python, Rust, Go, JavaScript, Java and shell scripts.</p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.wyllianbs.SlayerEditor.desktop</launchable>
